Scott O'Grady that occurred during the war.

16
01:20:45,714 --> 01:20:51,714
Released on November 30, 2001, Behind Enemy Lines
received generally mixed reviews from critics.

17
01:25:48,571 --> 01:25:54,571
It was a box office success, taking in $121.7 million
worldwide against a $40 million budget.

18
